            "review_title": "Review at Vinh Steak 'n Ale",
            "review_text": "Anh Thư\n3 contributions\n0\nEating in this restaurant is delicious than I thought!\nFeb 2020\nI just came back to Vietnam for another visit, because this is my second time travel in this country. I was really hungry when the plane arrived and my friend recommended me this restaurant named Vinh Steak N Ale. So I decided to give it a try. The food here is acually really good! I tried the Pumpkin Soup and the Ribeye 200gr Steak. I highly recommended you to try the food in here, you will be suprise when you taste it! 🥰❤\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 29, 2020",
