            "review_title": "Review at Vinh Steak 'n Ale",
            "review_text": "Andy Tram\n12 contributions\n1\nGood beef steak in Saigon\nOct 2019 • Family\nDear all, \n\nI would like introduce to you one of the best beef steak restaurant in Saigon. It is not only delicious also reasonable price. It is suitable for family and friend invite. The beef is done by chef Vinh who is the former chef of five start hotel in Saigon. You can feel the good smell of beef when you eat. It is soft and tasty. It was done by chef Vinh secret recipe. You can chose many of sauce when you eat with beef like mushroom, bbq....\n\nThe Vinh steak restaurant not only sale many kinds of beef, you also can easy to find other food like chicken, hamburger or thai noodle. Now they sale new item named is pate Hai Phong. You can order and eat with your breakfast at home.\n\nTry and taste it in Vinh steak ale restaurant 43 Hoa Lan, district phu nhuan. \n\nEnjoy your meal in Vinh steak ale restaurant !\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 5, 2019\nVinh Steak 'n Ale\nDear Ms. / Mr. Andytram2018,\n\nSincerest thanks for dining with us, and it was our great pleasure to serving you.\n\nWe are very delighted to know that you have had a great dining experience in our restaurant. Such comment like yours makes us feel so rewarded for all the endeavors we put into the job.\n\nWe are looking forward to welcoming you again in near future.\n\nBest regards,\n\nVinh Steak 'n Ale\nRead more\nWritten October 9, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
